@host = http://localhost:5080

### Drivers
GET {{host}}/api/drivers

### Create a job
POST {{host}}/api/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Acme Corp",
  "notes": "Fragile",
  "pickup":  { "lat": 40.7128, "lng": -74.0060 },
  "dropoff": { "lat": 40.7580, "lng": -73.9855 }
}

### List jobs (optionally ?status=Pending)
GET {{host}}/api/jobs

### Job detail with history (replace id)
GET {{host}}/api/jobs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Assign (replace ids)
POST {{host}}/api/jobs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/assign
Content-Type: application/json

{ "driverId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000" }

### Accept / complete / cancel
POST {{host}}/api/jobs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/accept
###
POST {{host}}/api/jobs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/complete
###
POST {{host}}/api/jobs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/cancel

### System status
GET {{host}}/api/status
